      "type": "graph",
      "title": "What a turn costs before the chemist speaks",
      "description": "The estimator ratio is billed input tokens over this system's own estimate of the same request: 1.0 means not yet calibrated, and anything above it is how much the context budget's chars/4 unit understates what the provider charges. The schema series is the half of the static prefix tests/test_context_floor.py cannot ratchet, because an endpoint tool's schema arrives from a server this repository does not build.",
